            "text": "<h1>Shipping &amp; Delivery</h1><p>After placing your order, you will receive a confirmation email.</p><h2>Order to Delivery</h2><p>From the moment you place your order, expect to receive it within <strong>4-8 business days</strong> — this includes crafting, quality check, and delivery to your door.</p><h2>Delivery in Israel</h2><p>• Door-to-door delivery via courier — <strong>Free shipping</strong><br/>• You’ll receive an SMS in advance, and a courier will coordinate delivery with you.<br/>• Studio pickup: available by appointment at Herzl 20, Tel Aviv.</p><h2>International Delivery</h2><p>• We ship worldwide with DHL Express. 🌍<br/>• Shipping cost: <strong>$50 USD</strong><br/>• From order to delivery: <strong>10-14 business days</strong> (includes crafting and shipping).<br/>• A tracking number will be sent once your order is on its way.</p><h2>Customs &amp; Duties</h2><p>International orders may be subject to import taxes, customs duties, or local charges. These are the responsibility of the recipient. We do not have control over these fees and cannot estimate them in advance.</p><p>For more details, we recommend contacting your local customs office.</p><p>If you have a specific deadline, please contact us in advance.<br/>📧 <a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\"><strong>info@noritamy.com</strong></a><br/>📞 <strong>077-645-0860</strong></p><h2>Payment Security</h2><p>We value your privacy and security. Your credit card information is never shared with any third parties or vendors.</p><h2>Cancellations &amp; Returns</h2><p>You may cancel your order within 48 hours of confirmation. After that, your piece will move into production and our return policy will apply.</p><p>Returns are accepted within 14 business days of delivery, provided the item is unworn and in its original condition. Refunds will be processed within 2 weeks of receipt.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong></p><ul><li>A 5% cancellation fee applies to all returns and cancellations.</li><li>Shipping, insurance, and tax fees are non-refundable.</li><li>Custom and personalized orders are final sale.</li></ul><p>Returns should be shipped to:<br/><strong>Noritamy Studio<br/>20 Herzl Street<br/>TLV<br/>Israel</strong></p><p>For return requests, exchanges, or assistance, we’re here to help:<br/>📧 <a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\">info@noritamy.com</a></p>",
